4. Aggregations and Grouping
Task 10: Count the number of albums each band has
sql
SELECT b.name AS band_name, COUNT(a.id) AS album_count
FROM bands b
LEFT JOIN albums a ON b.id = a.band_id
GROUP BY b.id, b.name;

